# UI / visual quality bar

- Never ship stock Roblox look: default blue buttons, SourceSans/Gotham-only stacks without hierarchy, gray `Frame` panels, unscaled offset-only UI, missing hover/press states.
- Prefer **scale** (`UDim2.fromScale`) + `UIAspectRatioConstraint` / `UISizeConstraint`; test phone + desktop safe areas.
- Before inventing UI chrome, check `refs/` and `.cursor/skills/roblox-ui-polish`.
- Prefer Creator Store / owned asset IDs for icons, VFX, character anims over procedural placeholder art.
- Characters: R15 + proper Animator; do not leave T-pose or default Animate as “final”.
